 ("table", ["Point", "Detail"], [["Title", "Amanda!"], ["Poet", "Robin Klein (Australian)"], ["Voices", "(1) an adult, probably Amanda's mother, who orders and nags; (2) Amanda's private daydreams, in brackets"], ["Form", "Free-flowing lines; the adult's commands are irregular, and the bracketed daydreams use rhyme"], ["Setting", "Everyday home; and three imagined places"], ["Tone", "Light, playful and sympathetic"], ["Theme", "A child's longing for freedom and the problem of constant orders"]]),
